# Power BI Star-Schema Build Guide & Reconciliation Check Values

**Project:** AccessLens-IE  
**Author:** Sohum Vivek Dhole  
**Star Schema Export Folder:** `outputs/powerbi/` (both `.csv` and `.parquet` provided)  
