---

## 1. Star-Schema Data Model (`outputs/powerbi/`)

Import the seven tables from `outputs/powerbi/` (prefer `.parquet` for strict data types or `.csv` with UTF-8 encoding):

| Table Name | Role | Row Count | Primary / Foreign Key | Grain Description |
| :--- | :--- | ---: | :--- | :--- |
| **`dim_academic_year`** | Dimension | `{{pbi_dim_year_rows}}` | `academic_year_key` (`1` to `{{n_academic_years}}`) | Academic years `2019/2020` to `2025/2026` (`is_latest_year = TRUE` on `2025/2026`). |
| **`dim_institution`** | Dimension | `{{pbi_dim_institution_rows}}` | `institution_key` (`1` to `{{n_hea_institutions}}`) | All `{{n_hea_institutions}}` HEA-funded institutions with `sector_group` and `is_maynooth` flag. |
| **`dim_county`** | Dimension | `{{pbi_dim_county_rows}}` | `county_key` (`1` to `{{n_counties}}`) | All `{{n_counties}}` Republic of Ireland counties (`{{pobal_ed_count}}` EDs, `{{pobal_total_pop_2022}}` Census 2022 population, population-weighted Pobal HP 2022 scores). |
| **`dim_rag`** | Dimension | `4` | `rag_status` | RAG status lookup (`GREEN`, `AMBER`, `RED`, `INFO`) with hex colour codes and sort order. |
| **`fact_institution_year`** | Fact | `{{pbi_fact_inst_year_rows}}` | `academic_year_key`, `institution_key` | Institution-by-year access KPIs (`{{n_hea_institutions}}` institutions x `{{n_academic_years}}` years = `{{pbi_fact_inst_year_rows}}` rows) and `2025/2026` NAP RAG statuses. |
| **`fact_institution_dimension_year`** | Fact | `{{pbi_fact_inst_dim_rows}}` | `academic_year_key`, `institution_key` | Atomic multi-dimensional breakdowns (`Programme Type`, `Age Group`, `Mode of Study`, `Field of Study`, `Course Level`) with `<{{small_cell_threshold}}` suppression flag (`{{suppressed_inst_dim_cells}}` flagged cells). |
| **`fact_county_year`** | Fact | `{{pbi_fact_county_year_rows}}` | `academic_year_key`, `county_key` | County-by-year Irish-domiciled total enrolments, Maynooth University enrolments, and rates per `1,000` residents (`{{n_counties}}` counties x `{{n_academic_years}}` years = `{{pbi_fact_county_year_rows}}` rows). |

### Relationships (Model View)
1. `dim_academic_year[academic_year_key]` (`1`) -> (`*`) `fact_institution_year[academic_year_key]` (Single direction, active)
2. `dim_institution[institution_key]` (`1`) -> (`*`) `fact_institution_year[institution_key]` (Single direction, active)
3. `dim_rag[rag_status]` (`1`) -> (`*`) `fact_institution_year[overall_rag_status]` (Single direction, active)
4. `dim_academic_year[academic_year_key]` (`1`) -> (`*`) `fact_institution_dimension_year[academic_year_key]` (Single direction, active)
5. `dim_institution[institution_key]` (`1`) -> (`*`) `fact_institution_dimension_year[institution_key]` (Single direction, active)
6. `dim_academic_year[academic_year_key]` (`1`) -> (`*`) `fact_county_year[academic_year_key]` (Single direction, active)
7. `dim_county[county_key]` (`1`) -> (`*`) `fact_county_year[county_key]` (Single direction, active)

