## 2. Page-by-Page Build Guide & Exact Reconciliation Check Values

Use the DAX measures in [`outputs/powerbi/measures.dax`](../outputs/powerbi/measures.dax) to populate the four report pages below. Verify every visual against the audited check values before publishing.

### Page 1: Executive Overview & Maynooth University Benchmark (`2019/2020` to `2025/2026`)
* **Slicers:** `dim_academic_year[academic_year]` (default `2025/2026`), `dim_institution[institute]` (default `Maynooth University`), `dim_institution[sector_group]`.
* **Top KPI Cards (Verify with `Maynooth University` and `2025/2026` selected):**
  * `[Total Enrolments]` = **`{{mu_enrol_2025_26}}`** (Sector total unselected = **`{{sector_enrol_2025_26}}`**; IUA Universities = **`{{iua_enrol_2025_26}}`**)
  * `[6-Year Enrolment Growth %]` = **`+{{mu_enrol_6yr_growth}}`** (`+{{mu_enrol_6yr_added}}` students from **`{{mu_enrol_2019_20}}`** in `2019/2020`; YoY = **`+{{mu_enrol_yoy_growth}}`** from **`{{mu_enrol_2024_25}}`**)
  * `[Mature Student Share %]` = **`{{mu_mature_share_2025_26}}`** (**`{{mu_mature_2025_26}}`** mature students vs **`{{iua_mature_share_2025_26}}`** IUA and **`{{sector_mature_share_2025_26}}`** All HEA)
  * `[Flexible & Part-Time Share %]` = **`{{mu_flex_share_2025_26}}`** (**`{{mu_pt_2025_26}}`** part-time/flexible students vs **`{{iua_flex_share_2025_26}}`** IUA and **`{{sector_flex_share_2025_26}}`** All HEA)
  * `[Deprived-County Catchment Share %]` = **`{{mu_deprived_county_share_2025_26}}`** (**`{{mu_deprived_county_enrol_2025_26}}`** of **`{{mu_county_mapped_2025_26}}`** county-mapped Irish students)
* **Visuals:**
  1. **Line Chart:** `dim_academic_year[academic_year]` on X-axis; `[Total Enrolments]`, `[Mature Share %]`, and `[Flexible Share %]` comparing `Maynooth University`, `IUA Universities`, and `All HEA Institutions`.
  2. **Clustered Bar Chart:** Peer university comparison on `dim_institution[institute]` filtered to `sector_group = "IUA University"`.

### Page 2: Access Pathways, Programme Type & Discipline Mix
* **Filter:** `fact_institution_dimension_year[dimension_type]` switcher (`Programme Type`, `Field of Study`, `Course Level`, `Age Group`, `Mode of Study`).
* **Reconciliation Check Values (`2025/2026`):**
  * National Standalone `Foundation and Access` (`Programme Type`): **`{{sector_fa_2025_26}}`** (up **`+{{sector_fa_6yr_growth}}`** from **`{{sector_fa_2019_20}}`** in `2019/2020`; led by ATU Donegal **`{{fa_atu_donegal_2025_26}}`**, TU Dublin City **`{{fa_tud_city_2025_26}}`**, TCD **`{{fa_tcd_2025_26}}`**, University of Galway **`{{fa_uog_2025_26}}`**, MTU Kerry **`{{fa_mtu_kerry_2025_26}}`**; Maynooth University **`{{mu_fa_2025_26}}`**).
  * Maynooth Broad Non-Honours UG Pathways (`[UG Access Pathway Enrolments]`): **`{{mu_ug_pathway_2025_26}}`** (**`{{mu_ug_pathway_share_ug_2025_26}}`** of MU's **`{{mu_ug_2025_26}}`** undergraduates; **`{{mu_ug_pathway_share_tot_2025_26}}`** of total enrolments).
  * Maynooth Honours Degrees: **`{{mu_hons_2025_26}}`** (**`{{mu_hons_share_2025_26}}`** of total enrolments, up **`+{{mu_hons_6yr_growth}}`** from **`{{mu_hons_2019_20}}`**).
  * Maynooth Field of Study Mix (`2025/2026`): Business, Administration & Law **`{{mu_fs_bus_2025_26}}`** (**`{{mu_fs_bus_share_2025_26}}`**), Arts & Humanities **`{{mu_fs_arts_2025_26}}`** (**`{{mu_fs_arts_share_2025_26}}`**), Natural Sciences, Mathematics & Statistics **`{{mu_fs_natsci_2025_26}}`** (**`{{mu_fs_natsci_share_2025_26}}`**), Social Sciences, Journalism & Information **`{{mu_fs_soc_2025_26}}`** (**`{{mu_fs_soc_share_2025_26}}`**), Education **`{{mu_fs_edu_2025_26}}`** (**`{{mu_fs_edu_share_2025_26}}`**), Health & Welfare **`{{mu_fs_health_2025_26}}`** (**`{{mu_fs_health_share_2025_26}}`**, up **`+{{mu_fs_health_6yr_growth}}`** from **`{{mu_fs_health_2019_20}}`** in `2019/2020`).
  * Combined Education + Social Sciences + Health & Welfare at Maynooth: **`{{mu_fs_edusoc_2025_26}}`** (**`{{mu_fs_edusoc_share_2025_26}}`** vs **`{{sector_fs_edusoc_share_2025_26}}`** All HEA).

