  * Maynooth University RAG Profile: Overall **`{{mu_rag_overall}}`** (**`{{mu_rag_n_green}}` GREEN**: Deprived-County Share `{{mu_deprived_county_share_2025_26}}` >= `{{rag_th_dep_green}}`; **`{{mu_rag_n_amber}}` AMBER**: Mature Share `{{mu_mature_share_2025_26}}` vs `{{rag_th_mature_green}}` target, Flexible Share `{{mu_flex_share_2025_26}}` vs `{{rag_th_flex_green}}` target, UG Pathway Share `{{mu_ug_pathway_share_ug_2025_26}}` vs `{{rag_th_pathway_green}}` target; **`{{mu_rag_n_red}}` RED**).
